        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Source of patient transference</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>Actually "transferred from department" but it includes hospitals and other facilities and appears to be a general concept.</obo:IAO_0000232>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>OMOP_CONCEPT_ID:4144257</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SNOMED:266751003</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:id>CLCO:0000015</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>is transferred from</rdfs:label>
    <obo:IAO_0000112>POSITIVE EXAMPLES:
"transferred from the emergency department" =&gt; is transferred from
"sent from the outside hospital" =&gt; is transferred from
"moved from the ward" =&gt; is transferred from

NEGATIVE EXAMPLES:
"transferred to the ICU" =&gt; is transferred to, NOT is transferred from
"admitted to the hospital" =&gt; is admitted, NOT is transferred from
"discharged home" =&gt; is discharged, NOT is transferred from

CONTEXTUAL EXAMPLES:
"The patient was transferred from the emergency department."
SOURCE: "patient" =&gt; patient; TARGET: "emergency department" =&gt; setting
RELATION: SOURCE =&gt; is transferred from =&gt; TARGET
"She was sent from the outside hospital."
SOURCE: "patient" =&gt; patient; TARGET: "outside hospital" =&gt; setting
RELATION: SOURCE =&gt; is transferred from =&gt; TARGET
"He was moved from the ward."
SOURCE: "patient" =&gt; patient; TARGET: "ward" =&gt; setting
RELATION: SOURCE =&gt; is transferred from =&gt; TARGET</obo:IAO_0000112></owl:Class>
    


