SOURCE: "medication" =&gt; intervention; TARGET: "blood pressure" =&gt; finding
RELATION: SOURCE =&gt; has effect =&gt; TARGET
"The antibiotic caused diarrhea."
SOURCE: "antibiotic" =&gt; intervention; TARGET: "diarrhea" =&gt; finding
RELATION: SOURCE =&gt; has effect =&gt; TARGET</obo:IAO_0000112></owl:Class>
    


