SOURCE: "patient" =&gt; patient; TARGET: "surgery" =&gt; intervention
RELATION: SOURCE =&gt; has intervention =&gt; TARGET
"He received physical therapy after the stroke."
SOURCE: "patient" =&gt; patient; TARGET: "physical therapy" =&gt; intervention
RELATION: SOURCE =&gt; has intervention =&gt; TARGET</obo:IAO_0000112></owl:Class>
    


