        <obo:IAO_0000112>The patient reported sore throat and his physical indicated swollen lymph nodes.</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Statement indicating that the patient or a specific finding site has a finding or condition.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>Was can_cause_finding_or_condition, a statement of medical knowledge about the potential cause of a finding/condition. Now just has_finding.</obo:IAO_0000232>
