        <obo:IAO_0000112>A cystogram was attempted today but radiology was unable to inject dye through her catheter.</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Statement providing the reason for abandoning an intervention or diagnostic process</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:id>CLCO:0000027</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>has abandonment reason</rdfs:label>
    <obo:IAO_0000112>POSITIVE EXAMPLES:
"stopped because of hypotension" =&gt; has abandonment reason
"procedure canceled due to poor tolerance" =&gt; has abandonment reason
