NEGATIVE EXAMPLES:
"procedure was completed" =&gt; completed, NOT has abandonment reason
"procedure was recommended" =&gt; recommended, NOT has abandonment reason
"procedure caused bleeding" =&gt; has effect, NOT has abandonment reason

CONTEXTUAL EXAMPLES:
